menu "ff-eink"

    config FF_EINK_BENCH_PATTERNS
        bool "Bench build: show test patterns, no network"
        default n
        help
            Each boot shows the next generated test pattern (chart, bars,
            checker), so each restart (SW8 or a USB-C replug) steps through them.
            USB host and the network never start, so the USB-C port stays a serial/JTAG
            device and the board can be flashed at any time. For gate G1.
            Build with: idf.py -B build-bench -D SDKCONFIG=build-bench/sdkconfig
            -D SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.bench" build

endmenu
